parameters.content:
## Astuces

- Définissez le schéma json attendu en cohérence avec votre prompt

- Exemple de schéma de sortie:
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "ticker": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Symbole de l’actif analysé"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date",
      "description": "Date de l’analyse (YYYY-MM-DD)"
    },
    "price": {
      "type": "float",
      "description": "Le prix à laquelle l'asset est tradé"
    },
}
```

parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "ticker": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Symbole de l’actif analysé"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date",
      "description": "Date de l’analyse (YYYY-MM-DD)"
    },
    "price": {
      "type": "float",
      "description": "Le prix à laquelle l'asset est tradé"
    },
    "trend": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["bullish", "bearish", "neutral"],
      "description": "Tendance du marché"
    },
    "signal": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["buy", "sell", "hold"],
      "description": "Recommandation d’action"
    },
    "confidence": {
      "type": "number",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 100,
      "description": "Confiance dans le signal (%)"
    },
    "rsi": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Breve description de l'analyse du RSI"
    },
    "ema20": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Breve description de l'analyse du ema20"
    },
    "ema50": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Breve description de l'analyse du ema50"
    },
    "ema200": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Breve description de l'analyse du ema200"
    },
    "comment": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Résumé concis (2–3 phrases)"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
